Z||000000||Voytek||12-07-2001||10:34 AM||||Ok.  This REALLY burns me up.<P>Last night, on my way from work, some lady calls into the radio station.  For you locals, it's Power 107.<P>She says there's an accident - a Fiero left the road somewhere.  So what does the announcer (Maz McFly) say?  He says:  'Thanks for calling in.  A FIERO, eh?  ALL Fieros should be taken off the road.  Well, maybe not in such way'.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>WTF??!  What th' hell does HE know about Fieros?  I bet he's never even owned one in his ENTIRE f*cking life.<P>See, it's bull like this that isn't helping me sell one of my Fieros right now.  I think I'll go and send this dude an e-mail right now (HellO, McFly, anybody HOME?, HeLLO!!).<P>Thanks for listening.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/voyteks_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||8
