Z||000004||MinnGreenGT||12-07-2001||11:39 AM||||You really ought to start out being nice.  You've got a slick ride, so ask if he's willing to go for a ride with you... might be fun on-air bit too   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>If that doesn't work, attack his lack of knoweledge and credibility!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>               <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by MinnGreenGT (edited 12-07-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000005||Voytek||12-07-2001||11:47 AM||||That's a good suggestion Minn.  I haven't had a chance to send the e-mail yet, but I will invite him for a ride.<P>Neal - Jerry Forbes is an a$$hole - anything I say will be modified appropriately and played on the air.  Besides, I don't normally listen to him just for this reason, so I wouldn't know where to start on the Fiero subject.<P>Roger - I assume you don't mean positive SUV comments.  Consider it done.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000006||Voytek||12-07-2001||12:12 PM||||Ok.  This is what I sent the guy:<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><BR>Hey Maz<P>I happen to be listening to Power last night about 5:30-ish when someone phoned in an accident involving a Fiero.<P>Do you know anything about these cars other than rumors?  Have you ever owned one?  I have owned 5 of them and am currently trying to sell one, therefore your comments you have made about the car definitely aren't helping me.<P>If you would like to discuss the Fiero, and why you think it's so bad, I would love to hear your reasons - please do e-mail me and I will be happy to enlighten you.  In fact, I can even swing by Power and take you for a spin; perhaps that will change your mind about giving the Fiero a bad name on the air.<P>Thanks and have a good day.<BR>V. Urbanson<BR><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Roger - sorry, I didn't end up saying anything about SUV's at THIS time - I didn't want to sound too argumentative for now.  We'll see if the guy comes back with a reply, and what tone he'll take up.||||reg||1
