Z||000010||SLAMMED87GT||12-07-2001||12:55 PM||||I shall hereby be know as "PENNOCKS FIERO FORUM RADIO ANNOUNCER REPRESENTATIVE DUDE!"<P>I'm sure you will be glad to know that I am a radio D.J. for Rockin' 101.7 in St.Cloud, MN. As you can see by the car below, Anything that is said about the Fiero on my show is good.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>In fact, I like to rip on those punks that drive Chevy Celebreties with "racing" stripes and cruise the main street looking for trouble!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"><P>Radio is almost always fun!!!!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Pfierosig2_1.jpg"> <P><P>------------------<BR>3" Drop, 17" Primax 618s/Nitto450 205/40, 4" Monza exhaust, Mudstain decklid scoop, 7" wing stands, Clear front and rear lights, custom interior, all options...that's all hehe.||||reg||6
